0..72 Comment "//! Transport of a function along `ua`: the cubical case table of Cohen,"
73..143 Comment "//! Coquand, Huber and Mörtberg, _Cubical Type Theory: a constructive"
144..187 Comment "//! interpretation of the univalence axiom_"
188..279 Comment "//! [Cohen-2015-cubical_type_theory_a_constructive_interpretation_of_the_univalence_axiom],"
280..358 Comment "//! § 4.5, read at a function type. The argument moves back along the path by"
359..432 Comment "//! the record\'s left inverse, the function applies, and the result moves"
433..465 Comment "//! forward by the record\'s map."
466..469 Comment "//!"
